                        "form": "inconnu"
                    }
                ],
                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "e67a5e36-ece7-3134-9854-9f31aa49bf35",
                        "entry_id": "3fbd72cb-a33d-338f-8487-d48f3afff05f",
                        "glosses": [
                            "Femme inconnue."
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "7becbb51-537a-43e9-9b42-cebf675f8271",
                                "sense_id": "e67a5e36-ece7-3134-9854-9f31aa49bf35",
                                "text": "Le feuillage de quelques arbustes froissés retentit dans le silence, comme le murmure d’une onde agitée ; mais quoiqu’ils prêtassent l’oreille pour saisir quelques nouveaux sons, la terre resta silencieuse et garda le secret des pas de l’inconnue, si toutefois elle avait marché."
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "ed73786b-34f2-3fbf-868b-d94b0fd48f7e",
                        "entry_id": "3fbd72cb-a33d-338f-8487-d48f3afff05f",
                        "glosses": [
                            "Quantité à découvrir en résolvant des équations."
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "95bf9317-8bf7-47d3-b894-ca8c19fa6756",
                                "sense_id": "ed73786b-34f2-3fbf-868b-d94b0fd48f7e",
                                "text": "Équation du premier degré à une inconnue."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "2b0c4348-60d7-43a0-bffd-fb112c73965e",
                                "sense_id": "ed73786b-34f2-3fbf-868b-d94b0fd48f7e",
                                "text": "Pendant les mois qui suivent, il entreprend la rédaction d’un fort sérieux ouvrage consacré aux équations cubiques. Pour représenter l’inconnue dans ce traité d’algèbre, Khayyam utilise le terme arabe chay, qui signifie « chose » ; ce mot, orthographié Xay dans les ouvrages scientifiques espagnols, a été progressivement remplacé par sa première lettre, x, devenue symbole universel de l’inconnue."
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "a2ccb7ef-ac26-39bb-8852-485546eb21cf",
                        "entry_id": "3fbd72cb-a33d-338f-8487-d48f3afff05f",
                        "glosses": [
                            "Circonstance que l’on ne connaît pas."
                        ],
                        "tags": [
                            "broadly",
                            "figuratively"
                        ],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "34c5302e-6afc-4d02-a6d5-e2b9a43bbed9",
                                "sense_id": "a2ccb7ef-ac26-39bb-8852-485546eb21cf",
                                "text": "Tout cela présage des lendemains inconnus — et donc terrifiants. C’est contre nature : pour un être pensant, clairvoyant — vivre au milieu d’incohérences, d’inconnues, de X."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
                "translations": [
                    {
                        "translation_id": "d84df082-16e9-4582-82fa-4551bb7619ca",
                        "source_entry_id": "3fbd72cb-a33d-338f-8487-d48f3afff05f",
                        "target_lang_word": "unbekannt",
                        "target_lang_code": "de",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "unbekannt",
                                "target_lang_code": "de",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "529a472f-356b-36d8-80fd-48fcfb63e501",
                                        "entry_id": "d2c720d4-7bd9-394d-adc8-2daf78549b3a",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "von wenigen gekannt, nicht im Allgemeinwissen vorhanden"
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "6eb427c3-6617-4d3d-8d50-529bc325d4d2",
                                                "sense_id": "529a472f-356b-36d8-80fd-48fcfb63e501",
                                                "text": "Der Autor ist unverdientermaßen immer noch ganz unbekannt."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "61514880-6f11-475b-bfe1-bcec8bd608f0",
                                                "sense_id": "529a472f-356b-36d8-80fd-48fcfb63e501",
                                                "text": "„Erfahrene Paragleiter wie Jean-Pierre attestieren Jordanien zwar ideale Bedingungen für den im Haschemitischen Königreich bislang fast unbekannten Sport.“"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "6b82d07b-38a4-45c4-9bf8-1bcf456ebbdd",
                                                "sense_id": "529a472f-356b-36d8-80fd-48fcfb63e501",
                                                "text": "„Die in Brasilien sehr verbreitete Tradition des Candomblés ist in Europa weitgehend unbekannt.“"
                                            }
                                        ],
                                        "sense_index_json": "\"1\""
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "2248e38d-4c61-3f43-af14-70d6ae52f6f7",
                                        "entry_id": "d2c720d4-7bd9-394d-adc8-2daf78549b3a",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "so, dass man etwas nicht weiß, kein Wissen, keine Informationen über etwas hat"
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "9abd2b94-89c8-4c6f-afd9-ee5ff0449829",
                                                "sense_id": "2248e38d-4c61-3f43-af14-70d6ae52f6f7",
                                                "text": "„Wie viele Menschen tatsächlich Mitglied der NSDAP waren, ist weitgehend unbekannt.“"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "6fa0f75d-f6b5-4adf-b05c-665d87b56793",
                                                "sense_id": "2248e38d-4c61-3f43-af14-70d6ae52f6f7",
                                                "text": "„Aus Gründen, die uns unbekannt sind, hat er sich dem Ort genähert, an dem sich die Tiere aufhielten.“"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "49405de6-9b11-4426-9411-d1a9abfaade2",
                                                "sense_id": "2248e38d-4c61-3f43-af14-70d6ae52f6f7",
                                                "text": "„Der Fall hatte in Hamburg für viel mediales Aufsehen gesorgt, die Verdächtigen waren dabei zunächst unbekannt.“"
                                            }
                                        ],
                                        "sense_index_json": "\"2\""
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "7dfe0bc8-1c19-4a58-8f3e-88138408239b",
                        "source_entry_id": "3fbd72cb-a33d-338f-8487-d48f3afff05f",
                        "target_lang_word": "unknown",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "unknown",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "1a5701e2-0dfe-309b-baba-5cfd3fcb5b72",
                                        "entry_id": "8015cf8c-752a-3678-9871-fc438f2a721e",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Not known; unidentified; not well known."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "postpositional",
                                            "sometimes"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "f425a7a7-6680-44fe-9538-962b5e0cbd44",
                                                "sense_id": "1a5701e2-0dfe-309b-baba-5cfd3fcb5b72",
                                                "text": "The Celebrity, by arts unknown, induced Mrs. Judge Short and two other ladies to call at Mohair on a certain afternoon when Mr. Cooke was trying a trotter on the track. The three returned wondering and charmed with Mrs. Cooke; they were sure she had had no hand in the furnishing of that atrocious house."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "ef044ffc-84ff-4369-bd1f-59879256d649",
                                                "sense_id": "1a5701e2-0dfe-309b-baba-5cfd3fcb5b72",
                                                "text": "I suspect that this large and complex military railway system, shrouded in official secrecy for most of its operational life, remains unknown to many people."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            },
                            {
                                "target_word": "unknown",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "da657c97-582b-3347-a0a7-61cb34fdd025",
                                        "entry_id": "cefa04e7-1144-3d81-88cd-2b1f6b010a7d",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A variable (usually x, y or z) whose value is to be found."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": []
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "2665e531-b64e-3a2d-a963-18199ddc61ca",
                                        "entry_id": "cefa04e7-1144-3d81-88cd-2b1f6b010a7d",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Any thing, place, or situation about which nothing is known; an unknown fact or piece of information."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "db1e7bef-c002-4731-8f1c-76cdd73b12b6",
                                                "sense_id": "2665e531-b64e-3a2d-a963-18199ddc61ca",
                                                "text": "Had God walked close beside her into the unknown?"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "502c1991-a3be-4c2b-81fb-f057e8817536",
                                                "sense_id": "2665e531-b64e-3a2d-a963-18199ddc61ca",
                                                "text": "I think I learned more from my family than they did from me in the brief idyllic time we spent together. None of them much more than a mile from home, they carried the aura of a close-knit community as a shield against against the unknown."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "7245f1f7-36d2-488d-8aad-31a7dea6634d",
                                                "sense_id": "2665e531-b64e-3a2d-a963-18199ddc61ca",
                                                "text": "As we know, There are known knowns. There are things we know we know. We also know There are known unknowns. That is to say We know there are some things We do not know."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "78becae2-c44c-4ea7-915d-84b9b871c9ba",
                                                "sense_id": "2665e531-b64e-3a2d-a963-18199ddc61ca",
                                                "text": "The other priority is getting people to respond well to interventions, especially changes to routine. This is one of the biggest unknowns in these scenarios, and yet compliance can be the most crucial factor in determining whether an intervention works."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "68e5a63f-6b1d-352e-b178-3c261f2d0e48",
                                        "entry_id": "cefa04e7-1144-3d81-88cd-2b1f6b010a7d",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A person of no identity; a nonentity."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "cd610cd1-2648-460d-b3d1-a4a0352c3bf7",
                                                "sense_id": "68e5a63f-6b1d-352e-b178-3c261f2d0e48",
                                                "text": "How does it feel, / how does it feel? / To be on your own, / with no direction home / A complete unknown, / like a rolling stone"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "0e343043-35b5-4366-9e2d-7a4f3118b926",
                                                "sense_id": "68e5a63f-6b1d-352e-b178-3c261f2d0e48",
                                                "text": "Khaleque, the landowner, who had contributed most of the money needed to transform the neglected burial-place of an unknown into a mazar, masked his pride and pleasure with difficulty. He solemnly declared: ‘Perhaps now we shall be forgiven for neglecting the saint all these years.’"
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            },
